{"text": "Soon Teddy came running down the path to play with Rikki. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just then, a tiny brown snake named Karait moved in the dust at Rikkis feet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Karait was small, but his bite was as dangerous as a cobras bite. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rikkis eyes grew red, and he danced up to Karait with careful steps. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Karait struck at him, but Rikki jumped on his back and bit him near the head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Teddys mother picked Rikki up and hugged him, because he had saved her son. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night he met Chuchundra, a sad little muskrat who always crept along the walls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nag is everywhere, cried Chuchundra, Can you not hear him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rikki listened and heard a tiny scratch, like a snakes skin moving on bricks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He crept to the bathroom, where Nag and Nagaina were whispering outside a small drain hole. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When there are no people in the house, the garden will be ours again, said Nagaina. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Go in quietly, and bite the big man first, she whispered.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "o", "n", " ", "T", "e", "d", "d", "y", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "r", "u", "n", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "t", "h", " ", "t", "o", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "R", "i", "k", "k", "i", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "J", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", ",", " ", "a", " ", "t", "i", "n", "y", " ", "b", "r", "o", "w", "n", " ", "s", "n", "a", "k", "e", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "K", "a", "r", "a", "i", "t", " ", "m", "o", "v", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "u", "s", "t", " ", "a", "t", " ", "R", "i", "k", "k", "i", "s", " ", "f", "e", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k"